  "metrics": "Six-class Macro F1 primary; Balanced Accuracy, QWK, decoded MAE, \u00b11 accuracy and per-class precision/recall/F1. Continuous MAE separately labeled. No probability metrics are claimed for scalar regressors.",
  "limitations": "Regression uses order plus an equal-interval numerical assumption; it is not a cumulative-link classifier. Exact threshold fitting can overfit rare OOF labels. Outer CV evaluates this whole fitting/selection process, but all estimates are exploratory on previously studied development data and folds overlap. Historical classifier search budgets differ. No final all-development model or independent-test claim.",
